        The root cause of the bug is likely related to the improper handling of the `coreAttribs` variable, which was previously defined outside the loop that processes each `SolrCore`. This could lead to unintended overwriting or sharing of core attributes across different cores, resulting in incorrect serialization of core configurations and potential errors during the operation of the `CoreContainer`.

        Commit message:
        SOLR-2331,SOLR-2691: Refactor CoreContainer's SolrXML
 serialization code and improve testing

